  "uid": "infrastructure",
  "title": "Infrastructure \u2014 edge and databases",
  "tags": [
    "archipellabs",
    "infrastructure"
  ],
  "description": "No exporter containers. Alloy runs blackbox_exporter and mysqld_exporter in-process, and the edge is measured from the gateway's JSON access log rather than nginx stub_status \u2014 which offers connection counts and one request counter, but no status codes, no latency and no per-host split.\n\ncAdvisor was here and cannot work on Docker Desktop: it reports only the root cgroup, verified across six configurations.\n\nTiles use `\u2026 or vector(0)` so an ABSENT series reads as 0 and turns red. Metrics are pushed here by Alloy, and a push pipeline cannot report its own death \u2014 if the collector stops, series do not fall to zero, they vanish, and a bare query renders 'No data' next to green tiles.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "requests / sec",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 36
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate({service=\"gateway\"} | json ua=\"ua\" | __error__=\"\" | ua !~ `archipellabs-probe.*|Blackbox Exporter.*` [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx in range",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 36
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"gateway\"} | json status=\"status\", ua=\"ua\" | __error__=\"\" | ua !~ `archipellabs-probe.*|Blackbox Exporter.*` | status =~ \"5..\" [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
